# A Play Custom game won and its replay played to its end (docs/phase-multiplayer.md, stage M7). As custom_melee.kps,
# the glue's screen opens on the install's maps folder (--data's) with its first map preselected and the races set
# Terran by the drop-downs (no creep: its borders are the seat's); Ok starts the game against the computer at once.
# The simulation's state CRC is marked at a step; the cheat "there is no cow level" wins the single player's game
# (ApplyPendingResults 0x4be020), the victory dialog's Return opens the score screen. Its Save Replay (a custom game's,
# SaveReplayButtonProc 0x4620c0) opens the save-replay dialog over it: the run's replays folder lists nothing (the
# dialog leaves LastReplay out), a typed name, OK copies LastReplay.rep to it and the button is disabled. The score's
# Ok leads to the campaign menu (a custom game has no next scenario). Load Replay lists the saved replay first (before
# LastReplay) and plays it: the same state at the marked step, and the replay's end where the game ended. Text input
# (its IME) is on only while an edit box has the focus, as SetKoreanImeEnabled 0x43f3f0 turns a Korean IME on around
# the text dialogs and off for play: the name's, the message line's, Save Replay's. tools/ci.sh runs it with --data on
# a 1.17 install that has its maps folder and wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
options originals
clock fixed

wait screen gluMain
click control glumain.single
wait dialog gluGameMode and still
click control glugamemode.original
wait dialog gluPEdit and still
expect text.input == 1
text "Script"
click control gluPEdit.1
wait screen gluLogin
wait frames 2
expect text.input == 0
click control glulogin.ok
wait screen gluCmpgn
click control glucmpgn.custom
wait screen gluCustm
# the preselected map's information and slots (PreviewMapEntry 0x45b970's 100 ms timer), then both races Terran (the
# opened race list's centre is its second row, as in custom_melee.kps)
wait seconds 0.5
press control gluCustm.28
move control gluCustm.28 0 0
release control gluCustm.28 0 0
wait frames 5
press control gluCustm.29
move control gluCustm.29 0 0
release control gluCustm.29 0 0
wait seconds 0.5
click control glucustm.ok
wait game
wait frames 30
expect units:0 > 0 and units:1 > 0 and creep.tiles == 0 and text.input == 0
wait tick >= 160
pause
mark played
log played tick sim.crc
resume

# the victory by the cheat: the message line opened, its text, Return
key Return
wait frames 10
expect text.input == 1
text "there is no cow level"
wait frames 10
key Return
wait dialog
expect text.input == 0
mark won
log won tick
key Return
wait score
wait frames 30
click control gluscore.save-replay
wait dialog savegame
wait frames 10
expect list.count == 0
click control savegame.name
expect text.input == 1
text "Custom win"
click control ok
wait nodialog and score
wait frames 2
expect text.input == 0
click control gluscore.ok
wait screen gluCmpgn

click control glucmpgn.replay
wait screen gluCustm
wait seconds 0.5
expect list.count == 2 and list.selected == 0
click control glucustm.ok
wait game and replay
expect replay.frames == @won.tick
wait tick >= @played.tick
pause
log replayed tick sim.crc
expect tick == @played.tick
expect sim.crc == @played.sim.crc
resume
wait replay.ended == 1
log ended tick replay.frames
